{"unit_id":"JasonQQ__dsh-btw-plugin#card-zh","repo":"JasonQQ/dsh-btw-plugin","commit":"ee0d6fc213d06d92d152d0eea19fae6aaeb826fc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@jasonqq/dsh-btw-plugin 是 DeepSeek Harness 的旁支提问命令插件，提供 /btw 命令并通过子 agent 单独回答问题。它默认使用 fork 子上下文，让回答能参考主会话已完成的对话，同时把结果作为命令响应展示。用户可以切换 provider，并设置子 agent 的递归深度上限；插件也会处理空问题、provider 不可用、运行失败和空回答等情况。适合希望临时追问又不把回答加入主会话模型历史的 DSH 用户。配置 provider 与 maxDepth 即可调整运行方式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:70-145","lib/index.js:153-160"]}
{"unit_id":"JasonQQ__dsh-btw-plugin#card-en","repo":"JasonQQ/dsh-btw-plugin","commit":"ee0d6fc213d06d92d152d0eea19fae6aaeb826fc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@jasonqq/dsh-btw-plugin adds /btw to DeepSeek Harness for side questions. By default, a fork subagent receives completed conversation turns, and its answer returns as a command result. Configure the provider or optional recursion-depth cap. Empty input and failed or empty runs return errors.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:70-145","lib/index.js:153-160"]}
