{"unit_id":"JasonQQ__dsh-btw-plugin#feature-1","repo":"JasonQQ/dsh-btw-plugin","commit":"ee0d6fc213d06d92d152d0eea19fae6aaeb826fc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@jasonqq/dsh-btw-plugin 的功能「独立上下文提问」：用户在会话输入框运行 /btw 并附上问题；插件将问题交给子 agent，默认 fork provider 可带入主会话已完成的轮次。（触发方式：/btw 命令）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:82-104"]}
{"unit_id":"JasonQQ__dsh-btw-plugin#feature-2","repo":"JasonQQ/dsh-btw-plugin","commit":"ee0d6fc213d06d92d152d0eea19fae6aaeb826fc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@jasonqq/dsh-btw-plugin 的功能「旁支回答不进入主历史」：子 agent 的文本回答作为命令结果返回并显示；插件返回 success 结果，不把它转换为主模型消息。（触发方式：/btw 命令）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:137-145"]}
{"unit_id":"JasonQQ__dsh-btw-plugin#feature-3","repo":"JasonQQ/dsh-btw-plugin","commit":"ee0d6fc213d06d92d152d0eea19fae6aaeb826fc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@jasonqq/dsh-btw-plugin 的功能「provider 与深度配置」：可指定子 agent provider（默认 fork）及可选 maxDepth，并在启动时传递这些配置。触发方式：运行 /btw。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:22-33"]}
{"unit_id":"JasonQQ__dsh-btw-plugin#feature-4","repo":"JasonQQ/dsh-btw-plugin","commit":"ee0d6fc213d06d92d152d0eea19fae6aaeb826fc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@jasonqq/dsh-btw-plugin 的功能「清晰处理失败与空答复」：命令遇到空输入、provider 缺失、启动或运行错误、非完成停止原因及空文本时，返回对应错误结果。（触发方式：/btw 命令）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:37-60"]}
